Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.33,0:07:20.46,Chemistry_07:20,Gu,0,0,0,track,Химия
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.33,0:07:20.46,Chemistry_07:20,Gu,0,0,0,track,Химия
